## Cohesion Audit: `src/blog/people/drafts/Marcus-Aurelius.md`

### Central Thesis
Marcus Aurelius's famous calm was not a temperament he had but a correction he ran on himself, privately, for thirty-three years without ever finishing it — the Type 1 signature of a man marking his own work in an empty room.

